<title>UK: TABLE-Thorn yr pretax profits 171.0 mln stg.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Thorn yr pretax profits 171.0 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March, 1997</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		  26.0		 vs    25.9</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	    9.6		 vs     9.6</p>
